---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import { resumePath } from '../data/profile';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="王伟权 · 作品集"
  description="王伟权的产品作品集：增长工具与数据平台案例、方法论与合作方式。聚焦从问题定义到结果交付。"
>
  <section class="hero content-section">
    <p class="eyebrow">产品经理作品集</p>
    <h1>把复杂增长问题，拆成可执行的产品闭环。</h1>
    <p class="lede">
      我聚焦广告投放与增长场景，长期在「数据平台 × 人机协同」方向做产品：从问题定义、方案落地到上线迭代，持续把假设变成可交付结果。
    </p>
    <div class="cta-row">
      <a class="btn btn-primary" href="/work">看我做过的项目</a>
      <a class="btn" href="/library">看我的方法论</a>
      <a class="btn" href={resumePath} target="_blank" rel="noopener">快速了解我</a>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="content-section">
    <div class="shelf-head">
      <div>
        <h2 class="shelf-title">建议先看这三部分</h2>
        <p class="shelf-note">如果你是第一次来，这里能最快了解我的能力结构。</p>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="card-grid card-grid--compact">
      <a class="card card--shelf" href="/work" style="text-decoration: none; color: inherit">
        <h3>案例库</h3>
        <p>看完整项目过程：问题背景、关键决策、推进方式与结果复盘。</p>
      </a>
      <a class="card card--shelf" href="/library" style="text-decoration: none; color: inherit">
        <h3>思考库</h3>
        <p>按主题沉淀方法与判断框架，记录我如何持续优化产品决策。</p>
      </a>
      <a class="card card--shelf" href="/about" style="text-decoration: none; color: inherit">
        <h3>关于我</h3>
        <p>快速了解我的经历、工作偏好与可迁移能力。</p>
      </a>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="panel content-section">
    <div class="shelf-head">
      <div>
        <h2 class="shelf-title">30 秒认识我</h2>
        <p class="shelf-note">目前在伙伴云负责增长侧产品，长期聚焦投放与数据平台方向。</p>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="tag-row">
      <span class="tag">伙伴云 · 产品负责人</span>
      <span class="tag">广告投放系统</span>
      <span class="tag">人机协同设计</span>
      <span class="tag">数据驱动迭代</span>
    </div>
    <ul class="flow-list" style="margin-top: 0.9rem">
      <li>职业主线从波波 0-1 到 TopSocial 多平台中台，再到 ASO / ASA 增长工具矩阵。</li>
      <li>擅长把复杂业务流程拆成可评审、可排期、可上线的产品路径。</li>
      <li>强调「看数 - 判断 - 执行 - 复盘」闭环，并把经验沉淀为可复用系统能力。</li>
    </ul>
  </section>

  <section class="content-section">
    <div class="shelf-head">
      <div>
        <h2 class="shelf-title">代表案例（先看这三个）</h2>
        <p class="shelf-note">每个案例都包含问题、动作与结果，可直接进入详情查看完整过程。</p>
      </div>
      <a class="shelf-action" href="/work">查看全部案例</a>
    </div>
    <div class="card-grid card-grid--compact">
      <a class="card" href="/work/asa-delivery-agent" style="text-decoration: none; color: inherit">
        <h3>ASA 投放 Agent</h3>
        <p>将异常预警、归因解读与建议采纳收口到同一工作台，验证投放决策闭环。</p>
        <div class="meta">
          <span class="tag">AI Agent</span>
          <span class="tag">异常监测</span>
        </div>
      </a>
      <a class="card" href="/work/asa-smart-delivery" style="text-decoration: none; color: inherit">
        <h3>ASA 智能投放平台</h3>
        <p>自建 ASA 投放后台并集成 AI 建议与一键应用，显著缩短看数改价路径。</p>
        <div class="meta">
          <span class="tag">广告投放系统</span>
          <span class="tag">智能投放</span>
        </div>
      </a>
      <a class="card" href="/work/bobo-weibo" style="text-decoration: none; color: inherit">
        <h3>波波微博数据分析平台</h3>
        <p>从 0-1 商业化落地，运营期年均收入超过 100 万元。</p>
        <div class="meta">
          <span class="tag">0-1 产品</span>
          <span class="tag">商业化验证</span>
        </div>
      </a>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="panel prose content-section">
    <div class="shelf-head">
      <div>
        <h2 class="shelf-title">方法论快照</h2>
        <p class="shelf-note">我的常用工作节奏，适用于大多数 B 端增长与投放场景。</p>
      </div>
    </div>
    <ul class="flow-list">
      <li><strong>定义问题：</strong>先对齐业务目标、角色冲突与约束边界，明确“做对”的判据。</li>
      <li><strong>拆解路径：</strong>把复杂流程拆成可评审的主路径与关键状态，保证研发可排期。</li>
      <li><strong>数据验证：</strong>围绕漏斗与核心指标做埋点和分析，用反馈驱动迭代优先级。</li>
      <li><strong>沉淀能力：</strong>把高频动作产品化、规则化，逐步形成可复用的系统能力。</li>
    </ul>
  </section>

  <section class="panel content-section">
    <div class="shelf-head">
      <div>
        <h2 class="shelf-title">当前状态与合作偏好</h2>
        <p class="shelf-note">如果你在看潜在合作，这里是最快的决策信息。</p>
      </div>
    </div>
    <ul class="start-list">
      <li>
        <a class="start-list__item" href="/about">
          <span class="start-list__title">我目前关注什么</span>
          <span class="start-list__desc">增长工具、投放系统、流程产品化与人机协同</span>
        </a>
      </li>
      <li>
        <a class="start-list__item" href="/work">
          <span class="start-list__title">适合合作的任务类型</span>
          <span class="start-list__desc">0-1 验证、多平台整合、复杂流程重构、增长提效</span>
        </a>
      </li>
      <li>
        <a class="start-list__item" href="/contact">
          <span class="start-list__title">联系与沟通方式</span>
          <span class="start-list__desc">邮箱或手机均可，通常当天回复</span>
        </a>
      </li>
    </ul>
  </section>

  <section class="panel panel-start content-section">
    <div class="shelf-head">
      <div>
        <h2 class="shelf-title">完整内容导航</h2>
        <p class="shelf-note">按页面路径浏览全部内容，适合深度查看。</p>
      </div>
    </div>
    <ul class="start-list">
      <li>
        <a class="start-list__item" href="/">
          <span class="start-list__title">首页</span>
          <span class="start-list__desc">网站总览与快速入口</span>
        </a>
      </li>
      <li>
        <a class="start-list__item" href="/work">
          <span class="start-list__title">案例库</span>
          <span class="start-list__desc">我如何定义问题并交付结果</span>
        </a>
      </li>
      <li>
        <a class="start-list__item" href="/library">
          <span class="start-list__title">思考库</span>
          <span class="start-list__desc">持续更新的方法论与阅读转述</span>
        </a>
      </li>
      <li>
        <a class="start-list__item" href="/about">
          <span class="start-list__title">关于我</span>
          <span class="start-list__desc">经历、能力与职业高光</span>
        </a>
      </li>
      <li>
        <a class="start-list__item" href="/contact">
          <span class="start-list__title">联系我</span>
          <span class="start-list__desc">合作方向与联系方式</span>
        </a>
      </li>
    </ul>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
